;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">Are you absolutely sure?</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">DrawerTitle</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">DrawerDescription</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">This action cannot be undone.</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">DrawerDescription</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">DrawerHeader</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">DrawerFooter</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Button</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">Submit</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Button</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">DrawerClose</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">        &#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Button</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#0550AE\"> variant</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#CF222E\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#99FFE4;--shiki-light:#0A3069\">\"outline\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">Cancel</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Button</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">      &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">DrawerClose</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">    &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">DrawerFooter</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">  &#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">DrawerContent</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFC799;--shiki-light:#116329\">Drawer</span><span style=\"--shiki-dark:#A0A0A0;--shiki-light:#1F2328\">></span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"composition\">Composition</h2>\n<p>Use the following composition to build a <code>Drawer</code>:</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"--shiki-dark:#FFF;--shiki-light:#1f2328;--shiki-dark-bg:#101010;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\"><code __raw__=\"Drawer\n├── DrawerTrigger\n└── DrawerContent\n    ├── DrawerHeader\n    │   ├── DrawerTitle\n    │   └── DrawerDescription\n    └── DrawerFooter\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"vesper github-light-default\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Drawer</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>├── DrawerTrigger</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>└── DrawerContent</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>    ├── DrawerHeader</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>    │   ├── DrawerTitle</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>    │   └── DrawerDescription</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>    └── DrawerFooter</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<h2 id=\"scrollable-content\">Scrollable Content</h2>\n<p>Keep actions visible while the content scrolls.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radix-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;drawer-scrollable-content&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"sides\">Sides</h2>\n<p>Use the <code>direction</code> prop to set the side of the drawer. Available options are <code>top</code>, <code>right</code>, <code>bottom</code>, and <code>left</code>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radix-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;drawer-sides&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"responsive-dialog\">Responsive Dialog</h2>\n<p>You can combine the <code>Dialog</code> and <code>Drawer</code> components to create a responsive dialog. This renders a <code>Dialog</code> component on desktop and a <code>Drawer</code> on mobile.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radix-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;drawer-dialog&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"rtl\">RTL</h2>\n<p>To enable RTL support in shadcn/ui, see the <a href=\"/docs/rtl\">RTL configuration guide</a>.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"ComponentPreview\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;styleName&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;radix-nova&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;name&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;drawer-rtl&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;direction&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;rtl&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx>\n<h2 id=\"api-reference\">API Reference</h2>\n<p>See the <a href=\"https://vaul.emilkowal.ski/getting-started\">Vaul documentation</a> for the full API reference.</p>"
